		line=1125,
	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010020d"},
		line=1125,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"It's past eight in the evening, and Koujiya Flowers has closed for the day.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"It's a little late, but we head over to have dinner.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"We soon arrive at our destination of Miyoshi, just a short five-minute walk from the shop.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"All you can see from the street is a nondescript side door behind a black fence no wider than one's outstretched arms.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Next to the door hangs a paper lantern with “Miyoshi” written on it.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You come here every day?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Most days. The manager, Hotori, and I usually eat together.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is it okay if I join you?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“But of course. The more the merrier, right?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The manager takes the lead and opens the door.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The entrance leads to a narrow alleyway flanked by bamboo fences on both sides.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"The path is paved with white gravel and stepping stones, lined intermittently with paper lanterns that beckon patrons deeper in.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"We walk for a while and turn left at the dead-end to find the entrance to Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"As I slide the door open, a lively atmosphere rushes out to greet me.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"With about forty people inside, Miyoshi is always filled to capacity around this time.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I guide Akari through the crowds with practiced ease as we take our seats.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's pretty lively in here.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The flashy entrance does a good job of discouraging first-timers.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is this place picky about their clientele?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, in a sense. This is a meeting spot for Sworn Blades members and associates.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But it does also front as a normal restaurant to keep up appearances.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, so they'd really prefer it if ordinary people didn't come in?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Miyoshi is a bit of a fortress.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"The narrow path to the entrance is riddled with traps to repel intruders.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The restaurant itself has a back door for quick escape and a hidden secret room; it's the safest place to be besides our actual headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Wait a second, if the manager is here, then...”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'm an associate member. You can consider me a part of the resistance.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“At the very least, I can come and go as I please without getting turned into a pincushion.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"He laughs jokingly.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry I didn't get your permission first, but I've already told the Blades about you, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's a little late, but thank you for your service.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“No, no, it's an honor.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"With our conversation having reached a stopping point, the owner, Mutsumi-san, takes the chance to bring us some hand towels.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Welcome.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Thank you for taking the time to tell her about the restaurant for me.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, this is Miyaguni Akari-san, the one we told you about yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My name's Miyaguni. Nice to meet you.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I am Sarashina, the owner of this establishment.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Thank you for your gracious patronage today. Please, make yourself at home.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sarashina? Could you mean that Sarashina?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehehee, indeed, that Sarashina.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Though nowadays, the only blade I wield is my chef's knife.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? But isn't Sarashina one of the Three Founders?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Yes, that certainly does come as a shock for many folks.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Though, one could say I am still keeping up with the blade arts, just with my kitchen knife.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san entwines her fingers in front of her with a twinge of embarrassment.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No, that's not the issue here...”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Well, if you'll excuse me, I have to attend to the kitchen, so please wait just a moment.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Leaving us with a polite bow, Mutsumi-san heads towards the kitchen.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"There is nothing artificial about Mutsumi-san's hospitality.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Rather than putting on any sort of pretense, she truly welcomes each of her customers from the bottom of her heart.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The head of House Sarashina turned her back on the blade? Why?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"House Sarashina, as one of the Three Founders, has always been a central pillar of the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"It sent shockwaves through warrior society when the head of the house decided to hang up her blade.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even still, House Sarashina is still part of the Sworn Blades, right?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Formerly.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“After the August Incident, the Sarashina faction withdrew.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Why?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know the details.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san is tight-lipped about their reasons.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"It is generally thought that they lost the will to fight after our chairman, Kokuan-dono, was arrested.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Now, now, there's a proper time and place for everything.\nLet's not spoil our dinner with all this gloomy talk.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Look, Hotori-san just arrived.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I look at the entrance and find Hotori making her way towards us.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Everyone she passes by casts her a reverent gaze as she makes her entrance.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Glad you could make it, Hotori-san.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're later than usual.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Recording ended up dragging on.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Hotori shows us an exhausted expression, but stiffens her face immediately upon seeing Akari.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll be joining you from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Please, have a seat.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"The manager slides over, and Hotori sits in his place.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Akari is to my left, Hotori is to my right, with the manager now sitting in the next seat over.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Welcome, Hotori-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I was just about to serve the first course, so please do help yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san serves us our food.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“First, we have fresh rapeseed blossom and sakura shrimp salad.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"The dark green rapeseed blossoms stand out vividly against the bluish-white serving bowl.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"The scattered sakura shrimp glisten with the light dressing, lending the dish an exquisite appearance and aroma.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But we haven't ordered anything yet.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Miyoshi has always only served set meals. There's no need to order anything.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh. That's a bit of a shame.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was kinda looking forward to it, you know. Ordering from a menu.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could it be that this is your first ever time eating out?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, pretty much.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I guess it would be, considering your lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Have you told Miyaguni about the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“After the scene she made at school, I decided it would be safer to tell her.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sorry for all the trouble I caused you.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Akari bows her head.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hid it from you, after all. It's really my fault.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, you're being too soft.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Without changing her expression, Hotori eats her boiled greens.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, you're in the Sworn Blades too, right?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's our chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Acting",
{"/font"},
" chairman. Don't get it mixed up.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Hotori emphasizes that part because she believes that Kokuan-dono is still alive.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono wields absolute authority in leadership over warrior society.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Even Maki followed the master's orders without question.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Hotori likely considers it presumptuous to name herself his successor.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"That said, it's been nearly two years since his arrest. The chances that he's still alive and well are extremely low.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm still unworthy.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maybe so, but it pleases me that you're still fighting.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That goes without saying.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If only the warriors hadn't been defeated, things wouldn't be as they are.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're mistaken.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Setting her chopsticks down, Akari interjects with a commanding tone.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Empress and the Imperial Family bear the responsibility for our defeat.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Watch your tongue!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Hotori also sets her chopsticks aside.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The warriors are to blame.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Now, now, now.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Tch!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Eep!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Hotori's dagger-like glare pierces the manager.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then let me ask you this. If the Sworn Blades were to be defeated in battle, would you push the responsibility onto your subordinates?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That'd be an entirely different matter.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No, it's one and the same.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her Majesty wasn't in command on the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That has absolutely nothing to do with being responsible.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It should go without saying that the Imperial Family ought to take responsibility for the Empire's defeat.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kgh!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Hotori's hand drifts towards her waist.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"The restaurant suddenly erupts in cheers.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"All the patrons' eyes are all glued to the television on the wall.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"A girl in a cutesy, frilly outfit is singing on the screen.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"She's Natsumi, a singer who became an overnight sensation after the war.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"The moment she set foot on stage, her cheerful songs stole the hearts of the Empire's downtrodden citizens.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Nowadays, not a day goes by that I don't hear Natsumi's voice.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They're airing that today, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Hotori's raised hand limply falls to her side.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? What's this?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's nothing...”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Hotori slumps further into her seat.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Have you heard of Natsumi, Akari-san?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I like her a lot.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Though I've been so busy that I haven't had much time to listen to her.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There you have it.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Gh...”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Hotori shoots me a downcast look.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Does Inou know her?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She is her.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Natsumi is Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori is Natsumi.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Whaaaaat?!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Akari lets out a loud shriek.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Just from that, the other patrons realize what's happened and start chanting Natsumi's name in unison.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Damn you all!”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"She howls at the other tables.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"The chanting stops at once.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“'Thanks for cheering for me, everyone!☆'”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Hotori returns to her meal with a completely vacant expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? But they're like... totally different people!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The makeup and wig do a lot of work.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't go spreading it around now.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sure, I'll keep it a secret. But why a singer of all things?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, that sounded like I'm making fun of you... Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It takes a lot of funds to finance the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Whether gathering intelligence or collecting spellblades, it all comes down to money.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Moreover, with our salaries revoked, many warriors are barely even able to maintain their livelihoods.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"On top of that, an underground organization like ours can't exactly go around soliciting donations.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"And so we hit upon the idea of turning Hotori into a singer.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Specifically, Shino was concerned about the Sworn Blades' financial situation, so she called on her connections in the entertainment industry.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"At the moment, the only people who know Natsumi's true identity are the warriors of the Sworn Blades, the manager, and Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Go ahead. Laugh.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What? I'd never laugh at you.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“U-Um, I really like Natsumi, you know? I'm rooting for you.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"With those meek words, Akari falls silent.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Amid the silence, Natsumi's cheerful singing fills the restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“'Alrighty, time for our last song! I hope everyone feels it right in their hearts!☆'”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Heh.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't laugh.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"The normally bashful Hotori has to play the role of a resolute warrior in front of the Sworn Blades and that of a lovable singer in front of the limelight.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Her struggles must be immeasurable.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"We finish eating and leave Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, hold up.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Hotori pulls me by the hand.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Akari-san, we should be going.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, yes.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Out of consideration for us, the manager leads Akari away.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have new information from Koyuzu about our operation to recover the spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They'll be transported in three days' time.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Thursday, huh?",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're lucky to be able to pinpoint both the time and the transport route.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like Koyuzu's doing good work.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah. That girl's desperate for everyone's approval.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Give her a pat on the back next chance you get.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're the one whose approval she wants most of all.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Heheheh, you got it.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Hotori smiles.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So tomorrow night, I wanna have a meeting at headquarters to go over things.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Okay.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's another thing you want to talk to me about, isn't there?”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You would've just e-mailed me otherwise.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Always a sharp one.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Hotori's smiling expression stiffens.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't tell Miyaguni about this operation, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wasn't planning to.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I do, she'll probably ask to come along.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You suuure seem to understand her awfully well after just three days.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Jealous?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“O-Of course not!”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I just can't stop worrying that she's deceiving you, that's all...”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, maybe she really is deceiving me.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If that's what you think, then stop associating with her.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Hotori sulkily pulls on my sleeve.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if I'm being deceived, I'm going to trust my instincts.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I don't, I'll regret it when death comes for me.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Hotori stares at me, struggling to hold back her emotions.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't take this the wrong way.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't ever regret how I've lived the past three years.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And I can't possibly thank you enough for all that you've done for me.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't want your thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I knew how lost you felt all this time too, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All I've ever wanted... was to be able to help you somehow.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Tears well up in Hotori's eyes as she speaks.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry. This isn't how I wanted this conversation to go at all.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's just... you're changing so quickly all of a sudden... I'm scared.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For me, um... it's enough for me just to see you doing well.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Just how many tears must Hotori have shed these past three years, all for my sake?",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"And yet in spite of all that, I still chose to associate with Akari over her.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"I'm filled with an overwhelming sense of guilt.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry I made you worry about me.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-I never said I was worried about you.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“A-Anyways, I'll see you at headquarters.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Hotori runs off, avoiding my gaze all the while.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
